      "en": "So he brought him into his house, and gave the donkeys fodder. Then they washed their feet, and ate and drank.",
      "ko": "그를 데리고 자기 집에 들어가서 나귀에게 먹이니 그들이 발을 씻고 먹고 마시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "04612d7219bc55ecd40bcc20a67767715b5acf4c4ec169af0877593f26bd648b",
