    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JDG:19:25",
      "sequence": 7050,
      "chapter_label": "JDG 19",
      "verse_label": "25",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JDG",
        "chapter": 19,
        "verse": 25
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JDG",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "But the men wouldn’t listen to him; so the man grabbed his concubine, and brought her out to them; and they had sex with her, and abused her all night until the morning. When the day began to dawn, they let her go.",
      "ko": "무리가 듣지 아니하므로 그 사람이 자기 첩을 무리에게로 붙들어내매 그들이 그에게 행음하여 밤새도록 욕보이다가 새벽 미명에 놓은지라",
      "source_text_hash": "226a9f94845841652446a2bd8176951aa6f0f48a5bad3a96273e9363ba4f165d",
      "translation_text_hash": "c43e815aaa64ba72536a9e3dd128447bca6baa3f87ebf2021c0a46232be8168f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
