      "en": "When he had come into his house, he took a knife and cut up his concubine, and divided her, limb by limb, into twelve pieces, and sent her throughout all the borders of Israel.",
      "ko": "그 집에 이르러서는 칼을 취하여 첩의 시체를 붙들어 그 마디를 찍어 열 두덩이에 나누고 그것을 이스라엘 사방에 두루 보내매",
      "source_text_hash": "ea375610a265b99cd96aa68f813fbd1f77997e73d34f7226f97dfd7ae1a3d830",
      "translation_text_hash": "fd3280b0c6dabf176292b4bace83d67307051da4416535d3463ad4462c63b4e1",
